'''Technology journalism''' is the genre of [[Journalism|reporting]] that concerns the development, marketing, and application of [[technology]]. The field covers a wide variety of topics, including communications, [[artificial intelligence]], the [[Internet]], [[social media]], the [[IT industry]], [[scientific research]], [[robotics]], and [[Technology policy|laws and policies]] regarding the digital world. Many news organizations feature prominent coverage of technology, especially as pertains to the economic, political, and cultural role of [[Big Tech]] companies and products.

